---
layout: base.njk
title: "Leadership: ECO-BRIDGE KAWEMPE"
description: "ECO-BRIDGE KAWEMPE's governance structure and Executive Committee, with each role's constitutional responsibilities."
permalink: /leadership/
trustbar:
  - label: "Governing body"
    value: "Executive Committee"
  - label: "Term"
    value: "3 years"
---
<section style="padding-bottom: var(--space-lg);">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="label">Who runs this organization</span>
    <h1>Leadership</h1>
    <p class="lede" style="color:var(--color-text-muted); max-width:64ch;">Governance runs through two bodies set out in our Constitution: the General Assembly and the Executive Committee.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="padding-top:0;">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="ledger">
      {% for g in org.governance_structure %}
      <div class="ledger-entry" style="animation-delay:{{ loop.index0 * 40 }}ms">
        <span class="field">{{ g.body }}</span>
        <span class="value" style="font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 1rem;">{{ g.description }}</span>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-alt">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="label">Seven elected seats, three-year terms</span>
      <h2>Executive Committee</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="objective-list">
      {% for member in org.executive_committee %}
      <div class="objective" style="grid-template-columns: 1fr;">
        <div>
          <h3 style="margin-bottom: 4px;">{{ member.role }}</h3>
          {% if member.published %}
          <p class="mono" style="color:var(--color-primary); font-size:1rem; margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);">{{ member.name }}</p>
          {% else %}
          <p style="font-style: italic; color:var(--color-text-muted); margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);">To be published</p>
          {% endif %}
          <p style="margin:0;">{{ member.responsibilities }}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="callout">
      <span class="label">The full record</span>
      <h3 style="margin-top:var(--space-sm); color:var(--color-text)">Elections, terms, and removal are all in writing</h3>
      <p style="margin-bottom:0">Articles 14 through 17 of our Constitution cover how the Executive Committee is elected, how vacancies are filled, and the process for removing a member from office. <a href="/governance/">Download the full Constitution on our Governance page</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
